 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Stick with classic disco tune. A lot of them are very danceable and easy to lead. Maybe You Keep Hidein' The Weakend by Mala Fun or If You Were Mine Another Way by Al Hibbert. Definitely. Invite some friends too, so it feels like a real party. Hmm, I believe it is. Which part doesn't sound right? It can be, but there are cheaper options. Roughly what you' pay for a night out anyway. A decent band will want a room of people dancing, so they need lot of customers. Nice. Then lead by example and show off any moves you have.",
